<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa in, deihtak Gaias thutak a ka it kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Deihtak, na kha in vualzawlna a muh bang in, bangkim a vualzawlna na muh leh na dam theihna ding in ka thum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute a hongpai un, thutak a na hindan leh na muanhuai dan a hon theihsak ziak un ka kipak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tate thutak ah a om uh chih ka zak kan a kipahna thupizaw ka neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Deihtak unaute mikhual himahle uh, a tung ua na hih peuh ah muanhuaitak in na hih zel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaite’n saptuamte ma ah na itna a theisakta uhi; amau tuh a zinna ua Pathian mi hihtuak him a na makaih leh na hih hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau Khrist min a a zinna uah Jentelte kiang a kipan bangmah lalou in a pawt zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in thutak a seppihte i hihtheihna ding in huchibang mite eite’n i kipahpih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saptuamte kiang ah thu neukha zaw ka gelhta; himahleh Diotrephes, a lak ua tungnun utnakpa’n a kipahpih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka hongpai leh a thilhihte ka pholhkhe ding a, i tung ua thu dikloupi a gen a a kamtam dan ka thei khesak ding hi. Huai leng hun a sa kei a, amah ngei in unaute a kipahpih kei a, a kipahpih nuamte leng khou in saptuamte lak a kipan a delhkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Deihtak, gilou mi omdan ching ken, a hoih chingzaw in. Thil hoih hihmi tuh Pathian apan ahi; thil gilou hihmi’n Pathian a mu ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetrias in mi tengteng phat a loh a, thutak a phat nangawn a loh behlap hi; eite’n leng i phat ua, hiai phatna a dik ahi chih na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kiang ah thu tampi gelh ding ka nei hi, himahleh laitui leh laipuan in gelh ka ut kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawtlou nungchiang in honmuh ka lamen hi, huchi in kimaituah in i kihou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khamuanna na tung ah om hen. I lawmte’n chibai a honbuk uhi. A min uh louchiat in lawmte chibai hon buksak in.
  </para>
</usx>
